        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. AUNCIENT-NATIVE-SOURCE-PAGETURNER.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-NATIVE-PAGETURNER-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-SOURCE-LOAD-OK           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-LIVE-AST-PROVE-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-RENDERMAN-RIB-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-PAGETURNER-WITNESS       PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
            PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-PAGETURNER.
            GOBACK.
        1000-EVALUATE-PAGETURNER.
            IF WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR = 00256 AND
               WS-SOURCE-LOAD-OK = 1 AND
               WS-LIVE-AST-PROVE-OK = 1 AND
               WS-RENDERMAN-RIB-OK = 1
                MOVE 1 TO WS-PAGETURNER-WITNESS
            ELSE
                MOVE 0 TO WS-PAGETURNER-WITNESS.
